{"id":"652507","name":"肉夹馍","author":"豫G老阿姨","authorId":"10882460","desc":"","cover":"images/652507/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"花椒八角","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五花肉切厚片放锅里煎出油。","img":"images/652507/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"五花肉煸炒出油。","img":"images/652507/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅留油放花椒八角喜欢辣的放辣椒炒香。","img":"images/652507/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入肉翻炒两下加水。盐老抽炖40分钟。","img":"images/652507/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"和点面醒发半个小时。擀成小饼。","img":"images/652507/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"馍烙两面黄。","img":"images/652507/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"肉炖好了。","img":"images/652507/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"青椒和肉都剁碎。","img":"images/652507/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"馍一夹，浇点汤汁。","img":"images/652507/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"香香，吃饭。","img":"images/652507/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}